# The gems actionview's tests load, at the versions the rails repository's
# own Gemfile allows: actionpack, activemodel, activesupport and what they
# load, activerecord and sqlite3 for the tests that render records,
# railties for the engine test case, rails-dom-testing and
# rails-html-sanitizer from their checkouts, and capybara for the test case
# matchers.
